    {
      "name": "The Moon Queen's Tomb",
      "type": "feature",
      "system": {
        "featureForm": "reaction",
        "description": "<p>The Moon Kingdom's final ruler has been preserved in a selenite coffin deep within the citadel. On a roll with Fear to investigate her chamber, her baleful shade awakens and attacks the party. Summon the Moon Queen's Spirit (Arch-Necromancer) next to her coffin and immediately spotlight her.</p><section id=\"secret-T4ooy4DmaUjaWXzA\" class=\"secret\"><p>Who buried her here, and why? Can she be resurrected, or is destroying her spirit the only path forward?</p></section>",
        "attribution": {},
